                "Add runtime validation for `roadmap_status_ready_if_linked` and `roadmap_apply_start_if_ready` by observing actual roadmap item state.",
                "Update dev-orchestrator prompt routing so roadmap hooks dispatch `roadmap-agent` through lifecycle hooks, then sync templates and distribute agents."
